    Welcome to the fourth support archive dedicated to GETUSERS! This archive
was written to support CNet Amiga, v3.05c and v4.26b+. Further support for
the extremely old v2.63 is no longer included, and all instances to this
effect have been removed from the various files.

    To get started, copy the entire "GU40Pack/" directory somewhere on your
system. I placed mine in a TEXTS: assigned directory, which is the directory
I'm using for storing "gfiles" in CNet, v4.26b.

    The various README files within this directory will instruct you how to
install and/or use the various included files, however I highly suggest you
immediately LOAD and PRINT the files "GU40_Shorts" and "GU40_Longs". These
files list the various getuser values you can use in CNet, so you will most
probably want to have these readily at hand.

    PLEASE spread this ARCHIVE around! Do not break it up and pass the
individual files around, as they have been put together to be used together,
and although there may be some files YOU my not have a use for, others MAY.

